manufacturer.</p><p>Sennheiser devices use the Qualcomm GAIA v3 protocol; Sony devices use MDR. Protocol knowledge comes from the BudsLink, SmartControl-Desktop, momentumctl and sennheiser-desktop-client projects. The Soundcore transport spike drew on OpenSCQ30 and SoundcoreManager.</p><p>Values this project has not verified against hardware are listed in<code> docs/PROTOCOL-UNKNOWNS.md</code>, along with how to contribute a reading.</p></div></div></div>"`;

